@startuml
    Visible --> Hidden : UC-10 Admin sets visible false
    Hidden --> Visible : UC-10 Admin sets visible true
    Visible --> Visible : UC-08 permitted owner edit
    Hidden --> Hidden : UC-08 edit preserves moderation
    Visible --> Removed : UC-08 permitted owner delete
    Hidden --> Removed : UC-08 permitted owner delete
    note right of Removed
      Soft-removal tombstone.
      Eligible resubmission creates a new Review.
      The removed record is not revived.
    end note
@enduml
